      "summary": "Pichai admitted in 2018 attempting to get Tim Cook to preinstall Google on every iOS device to create inseparable services, hoping for a win-win where Google gains search users/data and Apple gains revenue from a search agreement, but Cook refused as Apple does not preload third-party software."
